WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Hello! In this tutorial, I'll show you step-by-step how to use the Discord verification relay.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.000
First, open the website. You can switch the language to Spanish up here if you need to.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The page stays actively listening and waiting for the Discord verification email.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Now, attempt to log in to Discord. In a few seconds, the email will arrive here automatically in real time.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Here you can see the email details, including the IP address and the detected location.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:06.500
Finally, right-click the blue "Verify Login" (Verificar inicio de sesión) button and open the link in a new tab to authorize access, and that's it!
